WEBVTT

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:04.963
Sale-san,

00:00:05.172 --> 00:00:07.841
looks like everyone's really down.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:14.807
Loss of morale, I guess you'd call it?

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.475
Everyone's completely miserable.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.061
This is it for the pursuit squad.

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:20.729
What a crappy outcome.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:23.148
I suppose we can't just sit here and cry.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:26.068
We'll have to go ourselves.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:29.822
As soon as command
issues us our course...

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.448
Hey!

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.410
You haven't been
drinking at all, have you?

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:38.455
I couldn't drink right now.

00:00:38.664 --> 00:00:42.584
You always drink when
you mull over something difficult.

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.712
So she discovered that,

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.215
in the face of the Declaration
of the Grand Order,

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:50.384
not even the Puppeteer of
Devilish Skills can keep his cool.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.388
That Grand Order thing was
heard throughout the whole world.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.431
Which means Flame Hazes
across the world are

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.017
probably in the same
shape as those outside.

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:02.521
As someone heading toward the
battlefield, it's depressing to consider.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.148
It's fine.

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:06.692
A century ago,

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:11.864
I found myself. That enables
me to keep standing now.

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:15.659
I'm sure there are
lots of others like me,

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:17.661
doing their best to fight.

00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:21.373
That's our Chiara! So cool!

00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:23.667
But what about your two teachers?

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:25.294
Will you be any use?

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.462
If you don't mind the fact
that he's forgetting his drink.

00:01:27.671 --> 00:01:29.089
Shut up.

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:30.007
Well,

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:34.928
I was forced into a contract.
I didn't do it for destiny or revenge.

00:01:35.137 --> 00:01:38.432
So I guess nothing I hear will
stop me from fighting.

00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:41.226
Can you hear me?

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:43.145
Sale? Chiara?

00:01:44.313 --> 00:01:45.939
There she is!

00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:55.365
So these are the only ones who made it?

00:01:55.574 --> 00:01:59.453
Many of our allies still
flee through the mountains.

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:03.624
They've splintered off completely,
and will not regroup.

00:02:03.832 --> 00:02:07.127
The group will abandon our plan.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.504
Abandon?

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:12.883
Then we are not moving toward
the Palace of Heaven's Road?

00:02:13.091 --> 00:02:14.509
Correct.

00:02:15.052 --> 00:02:16.511
"We" are not.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:20.807
In other words, as the few
who have retained their sanity,

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:23.352
we have a greater
responsibility than retreat?

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:24.937
That is correct.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.564
We shall halt the enemy pursuit,

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:31.568
sending those who have lost their
way on to the Palace of Heaven's Road.

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:35.197
That's gonna be damn tough.

00:02:35.405 --> 00:02:38.367
But if we simply take them there,

00:02:38.575 --> 00:02:42.412
the enemy will learn the
Palace of Heaven's Road location.

00:02:42.621 --> 00:02:45.415
We will need every trick at our disposal.

00:02:45.624 --> 00:02:48.710
Search, guidance, pursuit interception,

00:02:48.919 --> 00:02:50.712
and concealing our
motives from the enemy.

00:02:50.921 --> 00:02:53.757
Despite the tricks we muster,
we do not have the manpower.

00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:57.427
Regardless, we must save those we can.

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:04.309
Everyone,

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:07.437
might I pose a question?

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:15.153
And the enemy forces on the plains?

00:03:15.362 --> 00:03:16.613
They've been eliminated.

00:03:16.822 --> 00:03:19.658
The survivors have
fled into the mountains.

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:26.081
Attention, pursuit squads.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.418
Expand your search area to
include the mountains.

00:03:29.626 --> 00:03:31.795
Your primary target

00:03:32.004 --> 00:03:35.173
is the mobile fortress,
the Palace of Heaven's Road.

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:40.387
Before scattering,
they were clearly headed east.

00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:45.183
So they must have something
there to enable their escape,

00:03:45.392 --> 00:03:48.228
which limits what could be there.

00:03:48.437 --> 00:03:50.022
You believe it to be the
Palace of Heaven's Road?

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.690
I've had the reinforcements,

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:55.235
from the north and south,
encircle the mountains at a distance.

00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:59.156
Even if they hide,
we'll draw them out eventually.

00:04:00.532 --> 00:04:01.408
Snow?

00:04:01.616 --> 00:04:02.951
No, rain?

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.578
Yes.

00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:11.251
My Burning Field is being destroyed.

00:04:28.685 --> 00:04:31.104
That isn't just
Sirotci's Unrestricted Method.

00:04:31.313 --> 00:04:32.647
That lapis lazuli-colored flame...

00:04:32.856 --> 00:04:35.692
This rain is the great barrier, Tlalocan?

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:39.571
You can't mean the
Four Gods of the Earth...

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.157
Those monsters are here?

00:04:42.366 --> 00:04:46.620
Even as a last resort,
why would they make such a tower?

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:49.039
And light a flame on it,
to ensure we see it...

00:04:49.247 --> 00:04:50.874
Is it a decoy?

00:04:52.209 --> 00:04:57.339
"Rout in the Rain"

00:04:59.674 --> 00:05:01.093
Come.

00:05:01.426 --> 00:05:02.928
Please stand.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.139
I know you can do it.

00:05:07.682 --> 00:05:09.017
You see that, right?

00:05:09.226 --> 00:05:11.311
Run toward the light.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.897
You will find a means of escape.

00:05:14.106 --> 00:05:15.732
There they are!

00:05:16.608 --> 00:05:17.150
Over there!

00:05:17.359 --> 00:05:19.444
Don't let them get away!

00:05:52.727 --> 00:05:53.728
This is...

00:05:53.937 --> 00:05:55.730
A transformation enacted
by my Tlalocan.

00:05:55.939 --> 00:05:58.108
But more importantly...

00:05:58.316 --> 00:06:03.655
Ask yourself again
why you were able to stand.

00:06:03.864 --> 00:06:05.073
As a Flame Haze,

00:06:05.282 --> 00:06:08.285
you must act, based
solely on what is before you.

00:06:17.127 --> 00:06:20.130
Allied forces in this area
are heading for that tower.

00:06:20.338 --> 00:06:21.923
The rain has cut off
long-distance communication,

00:06:22.132 --> 00:06:23.967
and we can't organize them.

00:06:24.885 --> 00:06:27.512
My Burning Field
has been disabled, too.

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:29.890
Is that what they're after?

00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:33.310
And we know it's a decoy...
What a disaster!

00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:36.229
Send a messenger to tell the
rear forces to hold their position.

00:06:36.438 --> 00:06:39.649
Reach the advancing squads,
and have them withdraw.

00:06:39.858 --> 00:06:41.860
If we let our encirclement collapse...

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:48.742
We won't let you approach!

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:52.120
If you advance,
we shall stop you, indeed.

00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:55.290
Have they come to draw me out? Then...

00:06:55.499 --> 00:06:58.877
So they draw the pursuit
squads toward that decoy?

00:07:04.132 --> 00:07:05.759
It's the General!

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:09.346
He's finally appeared, indeed.

00:07:09.554 --> 00:07:12.599
Thousand Changes Sydonay.

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:18.939
He is here?

00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:20.982
It seems so.

00:07:24.194 --> 00:07:25.362
We're almost there!

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:26.988
Don't stop!

00:07:29.199 --> 00:07:31.826
Excellent work, comrades!

00:07:32.035 --> 00:07:33.537
Into the tower!

00:07:40.001 --> 00:07:41.419
EXplodel

00:07:47.175 --> 00:07:51.596
Yeah, the work done by
the Beckoner of Brightened Dew

00:07:51.805 --> 00:07:54.266
and the Guardian of Steady Passage
has made our lives easier.

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:56.434
Easier? How?

00:07:56.643 --> 00:07:57.435
Yeah,

00:07:57.644 --> 00:07:59.479
we just sit here and wait...

00:08:02.607 --> 00:08:06.278
And we have an unlimited supply
of things to destroy and explode.

00:08:06.486 --> 00:08:08.405
You got that right!

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.290
It's unharmed?

00:08:18.498 --> 00:08:20.125
Fire! Fire!

00:08:22.127 --> 00:08:23.753
We make it seem like a decoy,

00:08:23.962 --> 00:08:26.006
while actually gathering
our forces here,

00:08:26.214 --> 00:08:28.633
to carry out our true objective.

00:08:28.842 --> 00:08:30.135
Yes.

00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.971
We will show them a
tactician's greatest trick,

00:08:33.179 --> 00:08:35.307
control over what
is false and what is real.

00:08:35.515 --> 00:08:38.268
You've finished your
job by now, haven't you?

00:08:38.476 --> 00:08:41.271
Try and stop me this time.

00:08:41.479 --> 00:08:43.273
I have always desired

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:46.192
to fight you at full strength.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:50.905
I shall handle them.

00:08:51.114 --> 00:08:54.409
While I do, at least get the forces
surrounding the mountain under control.

00:08:54.618 --> 00:08:55.619
Yes, Sir.

00:08:56.119 --> 00:08:57.537
Now, then...

00:08:57.746 --> 00:09:02.042
Our master never
ordered that I not kill you.

00:09:03.585 --> 00:09:05.629
Therefore, I shall kill you.

00:09:05.837 --> 00:09:06.546
Wilhelmina!

00:09:06.755 --> 00:09:08.590
Understood, indeed.

00:09:46.086 --> 00:09:49.381
All forces within the
encirclement have been saved.

00:09:51.633 --> 00:09:56.137
Your drawing the enemy
here made it go much faster.

00:09:56.346 --> 00:09:57.222
Not at all.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.516
It was only possible with
your rain and the tower flame.

00:09:59.724 --> 00:10:04.187
And we are not yet finished...

00:10:04.396 --> 00:10:05.271
Indeed.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:07.524
Now things get difficult.

00:10:07.732 --> 00:10:10.026
I hope this works.

00:10:10.235 --> 00:10:12.904
I hope we can make it work.

00:10:23.331 --> 00:10:24.082
What's wrong?

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:27.210
Hero of the Great War?
Contractor of the Dark God?

00:10:27.419 --> 00:10:30.422
This is not the time for caution.

00:10:31.589 --> 00:10:33.591
I hoped you would do that.

00:10:36.845 --> 00:10:38.346
Soaring Flame!

00:10:55.697 --> 00:10:57.198
That's what I wanted.

00:10:57.407 --> 00:11:00.535
I can expect even
more than this, right?

00:11:00.744 --> 00:11:03.288
If you are prepared to burn to
death amidst the flames,

00:11:03.496 --> 00:11:05.999
then feel free to attack, indeed.

00:11:06.207 --> 00:11:07.333
Unnecessary words.

00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:09.586
Prepared for death?

00:11:09.794 --> 00:11:12.630
Very well. I shall show you.

00:11:29.814 --> 00:11:31.065
What is this?

00:11:31.274 --> 00:11:33.610
They do not attack as fiercely
as their words would suggest.

00:11:33.818 --> 00:11:34.569
No.

00:11:34.778 --> 00:11:37.489
They have taken clearly unnatural positions.

00:11:45.038 --> 00:11:47.165
We can take it down! We can raze it!

00:11:47.373 --> 00:11:48.124
Now!

00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:49.959
Fire! Fire!

00:12:06.935 --> 00:12:09.062
Now! Attack!

00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:27.413
They will not stop until they've
completely destroyed that tower.

00:12:27.622 --> 00:12:30.583
In the end, we completely
fell for your gambit,

00:12:30.792 --> 00:12:34.504
Sirotci, my rival...

00:12:34.712 --> 00:12:38.424
Fight for what you care for, huh?

00:12:38.633 --> 00:12:43.096
Nothing has changed since I was human.

00:12:43.304 --> 00:12:44.097
However,

00:12:44.305 --> 00:12:46.766
that is the war I chose...

00:12:46.975 --> 00:12:48.434
My War!

00:13:05.243 --> 00:13:07.745
The decoy's role ends.

00:13:07.954 --> 00:13:11.583
The Palace of Heaven's Road
probably flees already...

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:14.669
Even if they are defeated soldiers,
with no effect on the battle,

00:13:14.878 --> 00:13:17.714
I do not wish to let them escape.

00:13:26.055 --> 00:13:28.182
One of the Four Gods of the Earth?

00:13:28.391 --> 00:13:30.310
This will be fun.

00:13:31.269 --> 00:13:34.439
Might I pose a question?

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:35.773
Depending on your answer,

00:13:35.982 --> 00:13:39.652
we may agree to aid in your escape.

00:13:41.279 --> 00:13:44.032
We will join the battle.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:48.453
Given that the Snake of the
Festival's words were correct,

00:13:48.661 --> 00:13:52.457
you may take this decision to
represent all four Gods of the Earth.

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:54.584
His words?

00:13:54.792 --> 00:13:56.878
That the creation of a new world

00:13:57.086 --> 00:13:59.589
will not affect this one?

00:13:59.797 --> 00:14:02.216
We Four Gods of the Earth...

00:14:02.425 --> 00:14:05.511
Our former teacher, the Heart of the Sky,

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:10.266
told us the true reason for the
storm in the rift between worlds,

00:14:10.475 --> 00:14:14.187
which foretells the great disaster.

00:14:14.395 --> 00:14:16.648
It occurs because
the Crimson Denizens

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:21.903
transformed humans into the unstable
energy called power of existence.

00:14:22.111 --> 00:14:25.823
As each portion of it
is lost, the world shakes.

00:14:26.032 --> 00:14:28.618
And those vibrations create waves...

00:14:28.826 --> 00:14:30.286
A storm in the rift.

00:14:30.495 --> 00:14:34.999
If the Creator God takes
his Denizens to a new world,

00:14:35.208 --> 00:14:38.586
that unstable energy
will return to this world,

00:14:38.795 --> 00:14:41.339
and the storm will subside.

00:14:41.547 --> 00:14:46.761
But if they act in the new world,
as they have in this one...

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:48.304
At some point, once again...

00:14:48.513 --> 00:14:49.889
Disaster comes.

00:14:50.098 --> 00:14:52.767
Of course, the people
on this side need not

00:14:52.976 --> 00:14:55.687
concern themselves with that.

00:14:55.895 --> 00:15:00.066
Even so, we Four Gods of the Earth,

00:15:00.274 --> 00:15:03.945
shall fight the Creator God,
the Snake of the Festival.

00:15:04.153 --> 00:15:05.196
Because...

00:15:05.405 --> 00:15:08.866
...this world, the Crimson World,
and the new world in the rift

00:15:09.075 --> 00:15:12.578
are all parts of the world.

00:15:12.787 --> 00:15:17.583
The Four Gods of the Earth
will fight the madness

00:15:17.792 --> 00:15:21.337
that would create an innocent new world.

00:15:21.546 --> 00:15:23.881
If you would accompany us,

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:26.092
we shall use all our power

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:29.095
to send you to the next battlefield.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.807
Shana, you will fight, yes?

00:15:33.808 --> 00:15:35.226
Yeah.

00:15:44.777 --> 00:15:45.737
I see...

00:15:45.945 --> 00:15:48.114
That strange positioning...

00:15:48.322 --> 00:15:50.700
There is a direction they do not attack...

00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:53.911
A direction they prevent my
attacks from striking.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.669
The only thing they would hide
here is the Palace of Heaven's Road.

00:16:01.878 --> 00:16:04.005
Did they make me believe
it had already launched,

00:16:04.213 --> 00:16:07.008
while they were hiding it here?

00:16:20.271 --> 00:16:21.773
True Crimson!

00:16:24.692 --> 00:16:26.027
Below us!

00:16:26.235 --> 00:16:29.906
Is that where the
Palace of Heaven's Road...

00:16:30.114 --> 00:16:33.576
...is hidden?

00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:39.832
Pierce through!

00:16:43.961 --> 00:16:45.379
Wrong!

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:48.674
What?

00:16:48.883 --> 00:16:51.427
Six little mice...

00:16:51.636 --> 00:16:54.305
...sat down to spin!

00:16:54.514 --> 00:16:57.517
Pussy passed by, and she peeped in!

00:16:58.935 --> 00:17:01.395
"Shall I come in
and bite off your threads?"

00:17:01.604 --> 00:17:03.815
"No, no, Miss Pussy!

00:17:04.023 --> 00:17:06.526
You'll bite off our heads!"

00:17:06.734 --> 00:17:08.820
"Oh, no. I shan't!

00:17:09.028 --> 00:17:12.281
I shall help you spin!"

00:17:16.285 --> 00:17:17.662
I'm tired.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.497
I want a beer...

00:17:20.456 --> 00:17:22.708
Well, you've been
out of it a long time.

00:17:22.917 --> 00:17:24.377
I'm glad you're safe.

00:17:24.585 --> 00:17:25.795
Rendezvous complete.

00:17:26.003 --> 00:17:29.674
Hey, it feels like it's been
a really long time, girlie.

00:17:29.882 --> 00:17:31.634
You're looking quite well.

00:17:31.843 --> 00:17:33.427
This is what I am now.

00:17:33.636 --> 00:17:36.430
More importantly,
how long will that seal hold?

00:17:36.639 --> 00:17:41.018
A little over ten minutes
would allow us to go with them.

00:17:41.227 --> 00:17:45.982
A true god shouldn't be greedy,

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.692
Lord of Atonement.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:51.112
We cannot undo the
Tlalocan right now.

00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:55.700
We need time enough
to make the enemy believe

00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:59.579
the true Palace of Heaven's Road
has vanished, and time enough that

00:17:59.787 --> 00:18:02.081
they do not know where you've gone.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.042
We all agreed on this plan, did we not?

00:18:05.251 --> 00:18:06.669
If we give any consideration

00:18:06.878 --> 00:18:12.258
to ourselves or to the Guardian of Steady
Passage, who fights their armies alone,

00:18:12.466 --> 00:18:14.302
all will be for naught.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.596
Even as we speak, time is lost.

00:18:16.804 --> 00:18:18.264
Hurry.

00:18:18.472 --> 00:18:19.891
That's right...

00:18:20.099 --> 00:18:21.434
Let's get started.

00:18:21.642 --> 00:18:24.562
Our ride should be here--

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.607
No way! He's already
broken the seal?

00:18:33.321 --> 00:18:36.073
You have more strength than this.

00:18:37.575 --> 00:18:41.287
Whom do I fight next?

00:18:44.957 --> 00:18:46.959
Thousand Changes!

00:18:56.844 --> 00:19:00.181
I see...

00:19:00.389 --> 00:19:02.934
You remain to delay me,

00:19:03.142 --> 00:19:05.269
and maintain the Tlalocan barrier,

00:19:05.478 --> 00:19:07.355
to aid their escape.

00:19:07.563 --> 00:19:08.814
Is that the plan?

00:19:09.023 --> 00:19:12.944
I'm sure the real Palace of
Heaven's Road is long gone by now.

00:19:14.487 --> 00:19:17.865
One of the Four Gods of
the Earth will die in such a place?

00:19:18.074 --> 00:19:18.908
Yes.

00:19:19.116 --> 00:19:22.161
As long as my power holds,

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.872
I shan't allow you to do anything.

00:19:25.081 --> 00:19:25.915
In that case,

00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:30.503
would you do us the honor of a battle?

00:19:30.711 --> 00:19:34.006
The plan is to stop me,
even should I refuse, right?

00:19:51.565 --> 00:19:54.402
The mission was successful...

00:19:56.988 --> 00:19:59.490
It really doesn't ever change.

00:19:59.699 --> 00:20:02.201
Nothing has changed
since I was human.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:06.497
But this is exactly
where I wanted to die.

00:20:08.082 --> 00:20:11.043
Zirnitra, my comrade,

00:20:11.252 --> 00:20:16.299
did you ever feel that an
end would come to my fight?

00:20:16.507 --> 00:20:20.219
Of course, my comrade,
Samuel Demantius.

00:20:20.428 --> 00:20:24.098
For six long centuries,
I have thought so.

00:20:24.307 --> 00:20:27.601
It seems that this is the time.

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:30.855
Will you die, Samuel Demantius?

00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:33.190
Yes, so it seems.

00:20:34.567 --> 00:20:37.945
As this is the second time,
it means nothing to me.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:43.075
Farewell, Samuel Demantius.

00:20:43.284 --> 00:20:47.496
I shall leave in anticipation
of the next battle.

00:20:47.705 --> 00:20:49.582
I wish you well,

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:53.461
my comrade, Zirnitra...

00:20:53.669 --> 00:20:55.588
I thank you for your cooperation,

00:20:55.796 --> 00:20:59.091
my comrade, Samuel Demantius.

00:21:21.739 --> 00:21:22.490
<i>Suddenly--</i>

00:21:22.698 --> 00:21:25.785
<i>What is holding you back?</i>

00:21:25.785 --> 00:21:26.160
It is well.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:32.958
<i>Like the endless rain, an excuse
is keeping you here</i>

00:21:32.958 --> 00:21:35.544
And we are in no position
to mourn an unexpected defeat.

00:21:35.544 --> 00:21:40.132
<i>You make your mind, look up, and
stand paralyzed once more</i>

00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:40.716
More importantly, when
will my body be able to move?

00:21:40.716 --> 00:21:43.511
<i>Aah, will it be sunny tomorrow?</i>

00:21:43.511 --> 00:21:43.719
Presently, it is fifty percent stabilized.

00:21:43.719 --> 00:21:44.553
<i>Enlightenment--</i>

00:21:44.553 --> 00:21:45.262
With our other tasks,

00:21:45.262 --> 00:21:49.392
<i>I looked at the silent blue skies</i>

00:21:49.392 --> 00:21:50.643
Very well.

00:21:50.643 --> 00:21:55.022
<i>The glisten in my eyes won't bow
to the blinding morning sun</i>

00:21:55.022 --> 00:21:55.398
Toward that place...

00:21:55.398 --> 00:22:01.320
<i>No matter how many times I may
break It's a hard intension like a stone</i>

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.322
Transporting our defeated troops
in the Palace of Heaven's Road

00:22:03.322 --> 00:22:05.533
<i>It all comes piling down again</i>

00:22:05.533 --> 00:22:06.158
through the enemy's
vast armies is impossible.

00:22:06.367 --> 00:22:09.453
So we decided not to do so.

00:22:09.453 --> 00:22:12.123
<i>For some reason,
we were trying to read each other</i>

00:22:12.123 --> 00:22:12.415
We dug a huge pit, concealed
the Palace of Heaven's Road there,

00:22:12.415 --> 00:22:18.379
<i>All these games do is
deceive yourself, so you lose</i>

00:22:18.379 --> 00:22:22.883
and led the recovered forces here,
via an underground path.

00:22:22.883 --> 00:22:25.719
<i>Sight of who you are and
have to pick yourself back up</i>

00:22:25.719 --> 00:22:27.430
the Guardian of Steady Passage
defended the tower as an obvious decoy;

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:28.973
<i>Ah, are we doing this again?</i>

00:22:28.973 --> 00:22:31.267
the Chanter of Elegies made them
believe a fake was hidden nearby;

00:22:31.267 --> 00:22:31.475
<i>I can faintly... hear</i>

00:22:31.475 --> 00:22:34.520
and in the end, the Beckoner of Brightened
Dew functioned as a rear guard.

00:22:34.520 --> 00:22:36.689
<i>Someone's laughter and someone's wailing</i>

00:22:36.689 --> 00:22:36.772
We lost the battle.

00:22:36.897 --> 00:22:39.066
<i>Right now, our worlds are linked</i>

00:22:39.066 --> 00:22:40.192
And after all that, what do
we have to show for it?

00:22:40.192 --> 00:22:44.989
<i>We always reached an
understanding in the end</i>

00:22:44.989 --> 00:22:45.990
All of us here...

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:49.827
<i>The answer, "if," is our hint</i>

00:22:49.827 --> 00:22:50.703
Whether it is enough or not,

00:22:50.703 --> 00:22:55.249
<i>We always reached an
understanding in the end</i>

00:22:55.458 --> 00:22:59.962
<i>There's no point if we don't go together</i>

00:22:59.962 --> 00:23:01.005
a good answer.

00:23:01.005 --> 00:23:09.138
<i>We will flutter in this land that
continues from the road of "if"</i>

00:23:09.138 --> 00:23:11.640
would you give the other three gods,
and my fellow priests, a message for me?

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:12.349
"Deux en un "

00:23:12.349 --> 00:23:15.436
"I have become a drop of rain,
and sacrificed myself,

00:23:15.644 --> 00:23:18.022
to force you to act.

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:20.900
And my friends...

00:23:22.693 --> 00:23:25.362
...the decision to fight

00:23:25.571 --> 00:23:29.533
is the right one, without doubt."

00:23:31.952 --> 00:23:35.956
After their complete defeat,
Shana and the others stand at a crossroad.

00:23:36.165 --> 00:23:37.541
Should they face Ball Masque again?

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:40.002
Is the construction
of Xanadu right or wrong?

00:23:40.211 --> 00:23:41.712
What path will they choose?

00:23:41.921 --> 00:23:44.131
Next time,
on Shakugan no Shana Final:

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:45.758
"To Battle, Once More."
